<title>RUSSIA: Russian T-bill yield falls to 32.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian T-bill yield falls to 32.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised average yield on an issue of 252-day GKO discount Treasury bills fell to 32.25 percent at an auction on Wednesday from 38.10 percent at an auction of 294-day paper on November 27, a Bank Aljba-Alliance official said.</p>
</text>
